OL,3,GNEWSAClimber's horror fall helps test
OL,4,ANHS breakthrough
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This can be a life-threatening
OL,7,Finjury," said Dr Edd Carlton, who is
OL,8,Fleading the study. Researchers hope the
OL,9,Ftechnique could speed recovery and
OL,10,Freduce complications.
